	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『機動戦士ガンダム THE ORIGIN IV 運命の前夜』より、スミス海の戦いで鉄騎兵中隊機と交戦した、シャア・アズナブルが駆る赤い「ザクI」がキット化！",
			"• 劇中使用武器がすべて付属するだけでなく、ヒート・ホークは手持ち用とマウント用の2種収録！",
			"• バックパックは新規造形で、各部マーキングはテトロンシールにより再現されている！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• From ``Mobile Suit Gundam THE ORIGIN IV: The Eve of Fate'', the red \"Zaku I\" driven by Char Aznable, which fought with the Iron Cavalry Squadron aircraft at the Battle of Smith Sea, is now a kit!",
			"• Not only does it include all the weapons used in the play, but it also includes two types of Heat Hawk: hand-held and mounted!",
			"• The backpack is a new model, and the markings on each part are reproduced with Tetron Seals!"
		]
	},
